which is a
[? whack-a-mole ?] style,

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:17.100
high-availability demonstration.

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:19.020
I mentioned high
availability briefly.

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:21.180
In this demonstration,
as I mentioned,

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:23.970
[? whack-a-mole ?] style,
you'll get to see how many Cloud

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:27.180
sequences can you make fail and
